@startuml
title 合约调用时序图 (Calldata 智能切片版)
skinparam participant {
    BorderColor black
    BackgroundColor lightblue
}
skinparam call {
    BorderColor black
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
}
skinparam return {
    BorderColor black
    BackgroundColor lightyellow
}

participant "0x12345678...5678" as addr_1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678
participant "0x87654321...4321" as addr_876543210fedcba9876543210fedcba987654321
    addr_1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678 -> addr_876543210fedcba9876543210fedcba987654321: CALL | Gas累计:120000 | Calldata切片: 段0:0x123456780000000000...
    addr_876543210fedcba9876543210fedcba987654321 --> addr_1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678: RETURN | 退出Gas:120000
@enduml